     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Just in case you missed it on the non-developers section of discourse.<div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Daniel</div><div><br><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">James Savage</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mc_...@discoursemail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Wed, Oct 5, 2016 at 11:30 AM<br>Subject: [The Stan Forums] [Modeling] Lunch tomorrow/chat + white paper about scaling models<br><br><br><div>\r\n\r\n  <div></div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"margin-bottom:25px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>\r\n        <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n          <tbody><tr>\r\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;width:55px\">\r\n              <img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Fsy77RKkWUJuRqGFZDstHTsELjVUJJhfpR1l6S6ogoFLI-PPtLUASasZIeuNtt3J7hZtA_L324o4XbDO4sIjUha7ENlfkvWKhgbd0xwtv9q3hUH8mFfRXfmm5o1eOctJhTvR0vREaMV99pMN_K2_sA=s0-d-e1-ft#https://cdn-standard.discourse.org/user_avatar/discourse.mc-stan.org/james_savage/45/26_1.png\" title=\"James_Savage\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\">\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td>\r\n              <a href=\"http://discourse.mc-stan.org/users/james_savage\" style=\"text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;color:#006699;font-size:13px;font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;color:#3b5998;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://discourse.mc-stan.org/users/james_savage&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471392733000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PzrKx95XOEKEKa-NM3WI3\">James_Savage</a>\r\n              <br>\r\n              <span style=\"text-align:right;color:#999999;padding-right:5px;font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px\">October 5</span>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n        </tbody></table>\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style=\"padding-top:5px\" colspan=\"2\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;border:0\">Lendable, the firm I work for, is currently scoping some work that will involve fitting models to much larger datasets than we are currently. As a part of this, I&#39;d like to put together a public white paper listing best practices/model design ideas to take into account when building production-scale models for transaction-level data. </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;border:0\">If anyone is keen, a couple of us are going to head to lunch tomorrow after the dev meeting to discuss these things. I&#39;ll take notes and post them here afterwards. Anyone else interested should feel free to join. </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;border:0\">Jim</p>\r\n</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"color:#666\">\r\n<hr style=\"background-color:#ddd;min-height:1px;border:1px;background-color:#ddd;min-height:1px;border:1px\">\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"http://discourse.mc-stan.org/t/lunch-tomorrow-chat-white-paper-about-scaling-models/95/1\" style=\"text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;color:#006699;background-color:#006699;color:#ffffff;border-top:4px solid #006699;border-right:6px solid #006699;border-bottom:4px solid #006699;border-left:6px solid #006699;display:inline-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://discourse.mc-stan.org/t/lunch-tomorrow-chat-white-paper-about-scaling-models/95/1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471392733000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MCLW2BL8CbtQZto0nis8y\">Visit Topic</a> or reply to this email to respond.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n  <div style=\"color:#666\"><p>To unsubscribe from these emails, <a href=\"http://discourse.mc-stan.org/email/unsubscribe/396c311267ab23e561746a2ec3f99805af2e08dd687a96027f1feb8d2b816c6b\" style=\"text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;color:#00669